        "created_at": "2014-11-26T13:56:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I kind of just sit back and let things unfold. It's very interesting. I'm usually late on the bandwagon for stuff, and most of the time when I get into their things, they're finished. I've been with Sentinels since the core set, and so it's been an interesting experience watching the game grow with the community.</p>",
